.idea

# The `kotlin` CLI wrapper, which test projects must not carry: they are run with the CLI under test.
kotlin
kotlin.bat
# ... but `kotlin` is also the name of the Kotlin source directories, which are a part of the test projects.
# Without this, any *new* source file would be silently ignored (the existing ones stay tracked).
!kotlin/

# We don't want these in tests currently unless included explicitly
module.xcodeproj
info.plist